//! stage: lex
//! dump
// Lexing continues after an error and produces a best-effort token.
a 12abc b //~ ERROR invalid suffix `abc`
c "x\qy" d //~ ERROR unknown escape sequence
e $ f //~ ERROR unexpected character
g ) h //~ ERROR unmatched closing
i 'xy' j //~ ERROR exactly one character
k 017 l //~ ERROR leading zero
m c"a\0b" n //~ ERROR NUL
o 0x p //~ ERROR expected hexadecimal digits
